{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829310/extras/5df90ff554017d6014a9b7786d0560e0.poster.avif?t=1762816402\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829310/extras/5df90ff554017d6014a9b7786d0560e0.webm?t=1762816402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829310/extras/5df90ff554017d6014a9b7786d0560e0.mp4?t=1762816402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Sublight is a single player survivor-like game where you captain a mighty battleship,<br>equipping weapons and upgrades to take on a fleet of enemy spacecraft.<br>These range from fighters to deadly capital-ship boss fights.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829310/extras/add5d176a6ec883299ced3e77918293f.poster.avif?t=1762816402\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829310/extras/add5d176a6ec883299ced3e77918293f.webm?t=1762816402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829310/extras/add5d176a6ec883299ced3e77918293f.mp4?t=1762816402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy and salvage enemy ships to level up your craft. Stay ahead of the ever increasing fleet of enemies being sent at you. With over 20 unique turrets and just as many upgrades* (as of alpha 0.9.0, many more are on the way!). The tools of destruction are yours to assemble. Just keep in mind your firing arcs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829310/extras/3f7d239bf781613dce24aff8086a81e8.poster.avif?t=1762816402\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829310/extras/3f7d239bf781613dce24aff8086a81e8.webm?t=1762816402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829310/extras/3f7d239bf781613dce24aff8086a81e8.mp4?t=1762816402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 8 different ships, each with multiple loadouts to unlock, no two runs will feel the same. <br>With some loadouts bringing unique built-in weapons to change up the battlefield.<br>Complete in-game achievements to earn currency to unlock new ships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829310/extras/da2c3c8d35a1efe68023fe760b7228d7.poster.avif?t=1762816402\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829310/extras/da2c3c8d35a1efe68023fe760b7228d7.webm?t=1762816402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829310/extras/da2c3c8d35a1efe68023fe760b7228d7.mp4?t=1762816402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3829310?t=1762816402","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3829310?t=1762816402","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829310/a31072c43183813c4ae30b3163bc82748eb6d192/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762816402","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829310/a31072c43183813c4ae30b3163bc82748eb6d192/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762816402","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829310/extras/5df90ff554017d6014a9b7786d0560e0.poster.avif?t=1762816402\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829310/extras/5df90ff554017d6014a9b7786d0560e0.webm?t=1762816402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829310/extras/5df90ff554017d6014a9b7786d0560e0.mp4?t=1762816402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Sublight is a single player survivor-like game where you captain a mighty battleship,<br>equipping weapons and upgrades to take on a fleet of enemy spacecraft.<br>These range from fighters to deadly capital-ship boss fights.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829310/extras/add5d176a6ec883299ced3e77918293f.poster.avif?t=1762816402\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829310/extras/add5d176a6ec883299ced3e77918293f.webm?t=1762816402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829310/extras/add5d176a6ec883299ced3e77918293f.mp4?t=1762816402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy and salvage enemy ships to level up your craft. Stay ahead of the ever increasing fleet of enemies being sent at you. With over 20 unique turrets and just as many upgrades* (as of alpha 0.9.0, many more are on the way!). The tools of destruction are yours to assemble. Just keep in mind your firing arcs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829310/extras/3f7d239bf781613dce24aff8086a81e8.poster.avif?t=1762816402\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829310/extras/3f7d239bf781613dce24aff8086a81e8.webm?t=1762816402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829310/extras/3f7d239bf781613dce24aff8086a81e8.mp4?t=1762816402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 8 different ships, each with multiple loadouts to unlock, no two runs will feel the same. <br>With some loadouts bringing unique built-in weapons to change up the battlefield.<br>Complete in-game achievements to earn currency to unlock new ships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829310/extras/da2c3c8d35a1efe68023fe760b7228d7.poster.avif?t=1762816402\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829310/extras/da2c3c8d35a1efe68023fe760b7228d7.webm?t=1762816402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829310/extras/da2c3c8d35a1efe68023fe760b7228d7.mp4?t=1762816402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></p>","developers":[" CODEBREW SOFTWARE LTD"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829310/34d8884fee07ae077333339c08bdf97a5c3da37e